KINETIX 3D (packages/kinetix_3d)
================================

This package ships third-party work. The viewer shows a short credit line under
every model and the full credits in "About this model"; the same text is in
assets/viewer3d/CREDITS.txt, which is bundled with the app.


1. BodyParts3D: human anatomy models
------------------------------------

The heart, brain, digestive system, lungs (respiratory system), eye, excretory
system and skeleton models are made from BodyParts3D,
(c) The Database Center for Life Science (DBCLS), licensed under
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
Source: https://dbarchive.biosciencedbc.jp/en/bodyparts3d/

KINETIX simplified the meshes, cut vessels short, split the ventricle wall into
left, right and septum, and added names, notes and animations in English, Hindi
and Kannada (tool/models/recipes). The model files derived from BodyParts3D
(assets/viewer3d/models/{heart,brain,digestive,lungs,eye,excretory,skeleton}.*)
are shared under the same licence, CC BY 4.0.


