3. Natural Earth
----------------

The coastlines on the Earth models (Earth's layers, seasons) come from
Natural Earth (https://www.naturalearthdata.com), which is in the public domain.


4. Built by KINETIX
-------------------

All other models (cells, neuron, flower, DNA, electric motor, prism, bar
magnet, atoms, molecules, solids and nets, Earth's layers, volcano, solar
system, seasons, atomic orbitals, hybridisation, crystal lattices, electric
circuit, AC generator, transformer, simple machines, ear, nephron) are built
in code by KINETIX (tool/models/recipes) and use no downloaded assets.

The build tools (tool/models) use three.js, esbuild, glTF-Transform and
meshoptimizer as development dependencies only (see tool/models/package.json).
